###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Relative RMSEs (RMSE divided by the label standard deviation) of 20 (main text) and 41 (SI) pre-trained MLIPs on AM26 are shown only in Fig. 2 and SI figures; the pre-trained models are not encoded as runs. Fine-tuning learning curves (Fig. 6) are figure-only; the zero-shot energy error is given only approximately ('~4 meV/atom').
# - AM26 is a candidate data-set registry entry (introduced here, openly available, Ref. 48).
# - Structure generation, ring statistics, excess energies and crystallisation simulations are property benchmarks.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/fragapane2026amorphous.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
